plan error: LogicalPlanError: Query planning error: closed variable-length path on a fully-unlabeled pattern (`(a)-[r*..]->(a)`): the untyped relationship expands to a per-edge-type UNION that only enumerates a single hop, so the multi-hop cycle count cannot be computed correctly. Add a node label and/or relationship type (e.g. `(a:Label)-[:REL*..]->(a)`) so the recursive VLP path is used. (#987/#1024)